{
"text": "Share by Email (opens in a new tab)",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F1405854141702195+-+The+Difference+is+Clear+Day+11%3A+Affordability+&+Tax+Relief%E2%80%9CI%E2%80%99ve+never+voted+to+raise+your+taxes%E2%80%9D+sounds+impressive.+But+because+of+the+way+income+taxes+work%2C+here%E2%80%99s+how+that+claim+is+not+unusual.At+the+state+level%2C+revenue+grows+automatically+as+prices+and+incomes+rise.+Connecticut+collects+more+through+income+tax%2C+sales+tax%2C+and+investment+funds+without+ever+changing+a+rate.+The+Legislature+may+not+have+voted+for+it%2C+but+you%E2%80%99re+likely+paying+more+income+and+sales+tax+each+year.Towns+are+different.+Costs+rise+with+inflation%2C+but+property-tax+revenue+doesn%E2%80%99t+keep+pace+on+its+own.+Every+budget+has+to+go+through+a+local+process+and+voter+approval.Michelle+evaluates+budgets+based+on+needs+and+resources%2C+not+ideology.+Some+years+that+means+cuts%2C+some+years+an+increase%2C+and+some+years+no+increase+at+all.And+that%E2%80%99s+the+difference.Vote+Michelle+Embree+Ku%2C+Democrat+for+State+Representative%2C+106th+District.%F0%9F%97%B3%EF%B8%8F+Vote+early+October+19%E2%80%93November+1+or+on+Election+Day%2C+November+3.=#TheDifferenceIsClear #MichelleEmbreeKu #CT106"
},
